  "content": "# Selected Papers on Cyber-Physical Internet Logistics Problems (2023-2025)\n\n## Search Results Summary\nBased on Google Scholar search for \"cyber-physical Internet logistics routing optimization supply chain management\" from 2023-2025, I found 15 relevant papers focusing on routing methods, optimization algorithms, and supply chain management.\n\n## Selected Papers\n\n### 1. AI-driven smart cyber-physical systems for optimizing supply chain route planning and logistics\n- **Authors**: SR Adapa, K Upreti, P Nijhawan et al.\n- **Year**: 2025\n- **Source**: Taylor & Francis\n- **Focus**: AI-driven route optimization using reinforcement learning for supply chain logistics\n\n### 2. Hybrid Algorithm-Driven Smart Logistics Optimization in IoT-Based Cyber-Physical Systems\n- **Authors**: AA Almazroi, N Ayub\n- **Year**: 2023\n- **Source**: Computers, Materials & Continua\n- **Focus**: Hybrid algorithms for logistics and vehicle routing optimization problems\n\n### 3. Cyber-Physical Internet Spatial-temporal Reasoning for Production Logistics Resource Recommendation in Industry 4.0\n- **Authors**: J Li, M Sun, Z Zhao, GQ Huang\n- **Year**: 2025\n- **Source**: Journal of Industrial Information Integration\n- **Focus**: Spatial-temporal reasoning and routing tables for Cyber-Physical Internet\n\n### 4. Routing protocols for B2B e-commerce logistics in cyber-physical internet (CPI)\n- **Authors**: X Qu, M Li, Z Ouyang, C Ng, GQ Huang\n- **Year**: 2024\n- **Source**: Computers & Industrial Engineering\n- **Focus**: Routing protocols for economical package routing in CPI logistics\n\n### 5. Shipment Scheduling and Routing Protocols in Cyber-Physical Internet for Prefabricated Construction Modules Logistics\n- **Authors**: Z Ouyang, Z Yuan, Q Chen, M Li et al.\n- **Year**: 2025\n- **Source**: IEEE Transportation\n- **Focus**: Genetic algorithm optimization for logistics of precast construction modules\n\n### 6. Cyber-physical internet based intelligent operation platform for off-site construction supply chain management\n- **Authors**: L Yin, T Li, G Li, S Besklubova, RY Zhong et al.\n- **Year**: 2024\n- **Source**: Enterprise Information Systems\n- **Focus**: Three-layered cyber-physical internet with routing algorithm optimization\n\n### 7. Cloud-based cyber-physical logistics system with nested MAX-MIN ant algorithm for e-commerce logistics\n- **Authors**: CKM Lee, CK Ng, SY Chung, KL Keung\n- **Year**: 2023\n- **Source**: Expert Systems with Applications\n- **Focus**: MAX-MIN ant algorithm for order assignments and vehicle routing problems\n\n### 8. Artificial intelligence in smart logistics cyber-physical systems: State-of-the-arts and potential applications\n- **Authors**: Y Liu, X Tao, X Li, AW Colombo et al.\n- **Year**: 2023\n- **Source**: IEEE Industrial Cyber-Physical Systems\n- **Focus**: AI applications in logistics cyber-physical systems and supply chain optimization\n\n### 9. Cyber Physical Internet (CPI)-enabled logistics infrastructure integration framework in the greater bay area\n- **Authors**: H Wu, L Huang, M Li, GQ Huang\n- **Year**: 2024\n- **Source**: Advanced Engineering Informatics\n- **Focus**: Infrastructure integration through cyber, physical and internet dimensions\n\n### 10. Establishing carbon footprints for modular integrated construction logistics using cyber-physical internet routers\n- **Authors**: C Ng, M Li, RY Zhong, X Qu, GQ Huang\n- **Year**: 2024\n- **Source**: Transportation Research Part D\n- **Focus**: Carbon footprint digitalization using CPI routers in construction logistics\n\n### 11. A dynamic and reactive routing protocol for the physical internet network\n- **Authors**: FE Achamrah, M Lafkihi, E Ballot\n- **Year**: 2024\n- **Source**: International Journal of Production Research\n- **Focus**: Dynamic routing protocols for Physical Internet networks\n\n### 12. Transportation service procurement auctions in cyber-physical internet\n- **Authors**: BQ Tan, C Yu, K Kang, RY Zhong, M Li, GQ Huang\n- **Year**: 2023\n- **Source**: IFAC-PapersOnLine\n- **Focus**: Transportation service procurement and route optimization in CPI\n\n### 13. Cyber-physical internet shipment execution protocols for aviation maintenance, repair and overhaul intralogistics\n- **Authors**: Q Chen, Z Zhao, Z Ouyang, Y Wang, Z Yuan et al.\n- **Year**: 2025\n- **Source**: Computers & Industrial Engineering\n- **Focus**: Shipment execution protocols for aviation MRO logistics\n\n### 14. Limited data-driven router bandwidth configuration for cyber physical internet\n- **Authors**: Y You, M Li\n- **Year**: 2025\n- **Source**: Expert Systems with Applications\n- **Focus**: Router bandwidth configuration for supply and demand balance\n\n### 15. Metaheuristic algorithms and their applications in performance optimization of cyber-physical systems having applications in logistics\n- **Authors**: M Saini, VS Maan, A Kumar, DK Saini\n- **Year**: 2024\n- **Source**: Springer Engineering and Management\n- **Focus**: Metaheuristic algorithms for CPS performance optimization in logistics\n\n## Key Research Areas\n1. **Routing Optimization**: Various algorithms including genetic algorithms, ant colony optimization, and reinforcement learning\n2. **Cyber-Physical Internet (CPI)**: Integration of cyber, physical and internet dimensions for logistics\n3. **Supply Chain Management**: Optimization of supply chain operations using cyber-physical systems\n4. **IoT Integration**: Smart logistics systems based on IoT technologies\n5. **Sustainability**: Carbon footprint management and environmental optimization\n\n## Research Institutions\nMajor contributors include researchers from Hong Kong Polytechnic University, various Chinese universities, and international collaborations focusing on cyber-physical systems in logistics.",
