em in smart warehouse**\n   - DOI: S2405896323012041\n   - Abstract: This paper presents a Multi-Agent System (MAS)-based distributed cyber-physical system for smart warehouse operations.\n\n3. **Autonomous mobile robotics in smart warehousing: a cyber-physical systems approach to inventory management**\n   - DOI: Not directly available, but the source is Future Technology, 2025.\n   - Abstract: This paper proposes a novel cyber-physical systems framework for integrating autonomous mobile robots in warehouse environments, focusing on intelligent inventory management.\n\n4. **A Digital Twin Approach for Adaptive Compliance in Cyber-Physical Systems: Case of Smart Warehouse Logistics**\n   - DOI: 10.48550/arXiv.2310.07116\n   - Abstract: This paper explores a Digital Twin approach for adaptive compliance in cyber-physical systems, specifically in the context of smart warehouse logistics.\n\n5. **Smart Warehousing as a Wave of the Future**\n   - DOI: 10.3390/logistics7020030\n   - Abstract: This paper discusses smart warehousing, with a focus on the core cyber-physical system (CPS) that enables autonomous decision-making through the seamless integration of cyber and physical aspects.",
