.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trump_administration_family_separation_policy \\\"Trump administration family separation policy\\\")\\n    * [migrant detentions](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Migrant_detentions_under_the_first_Trump_administration \\\"Migrant detentions under the first Trump administration\\\")\\n    * [troop deployments](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Faithful_Patriot \\\"Operation Faithful Patriot\\\")\\n    * [national emergency](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Emergency_Concerning_the_Southern_Border_of_the_United_States \\\"National Emergency Concerning the Southern Border of the United States\\\")\\n  * [Infrastructure](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Infrastructure_policy_of_Donald_Trump \\\"Infrastructure policy of Donald Trump\\\")\\n  * [Social issues](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Social_policy_of_the_first_Trump_administration \\\"Social policy of the first Trump administration\\\")\\n    * [First Step Act](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_Step_Act \\\"First Step Act\\\")\\n    * [cannabis](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cannabis_policy_of_the_first_Trump_administration \\\"Cannabis policy of the first Trump administration\\\")\\n  * [Space](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Space_policy_of_the_first_Trump_administration \\\"Space policy of the first Trump administration\\\")\\n  * [COVID-19 pandemic](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/COVID-19_pandemic_in_the_United_States \\\"COVID-19 pandemic in the United States\\\")\\n    * [Taskforce](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/White_House_Coronavirus_Task_Force \\\"White House Coronavirus Task Force\\\")\\n    * [Communication](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Communication_of_the_Trump_administration_during_the_COVID-19_pandemic \\\"Communication of the Trump administration during the COVID-19 pandemic\\\")\\n    * [Government response](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U.S._federal_government_response_to_the_COVID-19_pandemic \\\"U.S. federal government response to the COVID-19 pandemic\\\")\\n      * [stimulus bills](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stimulus_\\\\(economics\\\\) \\\"Stimulus \\\\(economics\\\\)\\\")\\n        * [CARES Act](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CARES_Act \\\"CARES Act\\\")\\n        * [Consolidated Appropriations Act, 2021](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Consolidated_Appropriations_Act,_2021 \\\"Consolidated Appropriations Act, 2021\\\")\\n      * [Operation Warp Speed](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Warp_Speed \\\"Operation Warp Speed\\\")\\n    * [Interference with science agencies](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Political_interference_with_science_agencies_by_the_first_Trump_administration \\\"Political interference with science agencies by the first Trump administration\\\")\\n  * [Targeting of political opponents and civil society](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Targeting_of_political_opponents_and_civil_society_under_the_second_Trump_administration \\\"Targeting of political opponents and civil society under the second Trump administration\\\")\\n\\n\\n* * *\\nAppointments (\\n  * [first](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Political_appointments_of_the_first_Trump_administration \\\"Political appointments of the first Trump administration\\\")\\n  * [second](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Political_appointments_of_the_second_Trump_administration \\\"Political appointments of the second Trump administration\\\")\\n\\n)\\n  * Cabinets \\n    * [first](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_cabinet_of_Donald_Trump \\\"First cabinet of Donald Trump\\\")\\n    * [second](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_cabinet_of_Donald_Trump \\\"Second cabinet of Donald Trump\\\")\\n  * Ambassadors \\n    * [first](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_ambassadors_appointed_by_Donald_Trump_\\\\(2017%E2%80%932021\\\\) \\\"List of ambassadors appointed by Donald Trump \\\\(2017–2021\\\\)\\\")\\n    * [second](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_ambassadors_nominated_by_Donald_Trump_\\\\(2025%E2%80%932029\\\\) \\\"List of ambassadors nominated by Donald Tru